Z||000008||SloPonti||01-12-2000||12:03 AM||||the wiring stuff is called wiring loom! it is just like the factory black loom that is on your car now! there is also different colors to chose from! you can get it from summit but i found it at winners circle which is a local racing shop in my town! it is pretty cheap! it is like four bucks for about 7 feet or 10 bucks for 25 feet! go with the 25 feet because you will use it! the red thing you see is red electrical tape because the wiring loom companies only make the t sections in 1/2 inch and they are black in color! i used 1/4 inch 3/8 inch 1/3 inch and 3/4 inch! i think it gives the cars motor compartment some color! i will post pictures of the car when the motor is in!!<BR>thanks<BR>Rob||||reg||1
