Z||000011||ChadMan||01-12-2000||08:50 AM||||So that's the Hooker header, huh?  No wonder you were so excited - it looks great.  I can't quite tell from the pix, but is that little hole in the top of the pipe a provision for the O2 sensor?<P>Some questions:  What kind of cat are you going to use?  How about the rest of the exhaust?  You can probably pick up a factory dual setup from somebody - rumor has it the Indy and SE 4-bangers used the same cat-back exhaust as the V6 cars.  (Somebody please correct me if I'm wrong)<P>That's a beautiful, clean-looking Duck, Rob.||||reg||10
